1
00:00:13,266 --> 00:00:14,166
The back of the ghost plate

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,300
is the map of the Tian Gong Building.

3
00:00:33,966 --> 00:00:35,266
Okay, little brother.

4
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:37,100
I didn't help you in vain.

5
00:00:43,433 --> 00:00:45,133
That ghost master,

6
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:49,733
do you want to sell this ghost plate to me?

7
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:50,833
Just name your price.

8
00:00:51,266 --> 00:00:52,100
I will never bargain.

9
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,400
Fei,

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,933
Do you remember?

11
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,133
Before your mother left,

12
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,600
made an engagement for us.

13
00:00:58,933 --> 00:00:59,633
The will of parents.

14
00:00:59,766 --> 00:01:00,666
ancestral blood contract.

15
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,333
I will never.

16
00:01:03,433 --> 00:01:04,166
What?

17
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:05,633
engagement.

18
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:08,233
Of course I remember.

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,800
But I remember more ten years ago

20
00:01:11,166 --> 00:01:13,300
how your Miao family ignored my life.

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
The Nine-Li Ghost Disk

22
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,766
is mine alone,

23
00:01:18,133 --> 00:01:20,633
It has nothing to do with all of you.

24
00:01:26,766 --> 00:01:27,800
What is it?

25
00:01:33,066 --> 00:01:35,233
It's the Gu worms in the clay figurines that control them.

26
00:01:40,366 --> 00:01:43,466
Long Fei was judged as evil by Elder Lei for Guishou.

27
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:47,100
I didn't expect that these hands could control the worms.

28
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,333
Ten years,

29
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,466
I finally came out.

30
00:02:44,433 --> 00:02:45,433
Mom.

31
00:02:46,066 --> 00:02:46,833
Don't go.

32
00:02:48,266 --> 00:02:49,266
Fei'er,

33
00:02:49,766 --> 00:02:52,600
You were bitten by the escaped Gu worms in Tian Gong Tower.

34
00:02:52,833 --> 00:02:54,500
That's why you became the ghost hand.

35
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:57,100
I'll go to the Tian Gong Building to find the antidote.

36
00:02:57,766 --> 00:02:59,066
I'll be back soon.

37
00:03:00,266 --> 00:03:01,500
Mom.

38
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:07,166
Mom.

39
00:03:07,466 --> 00:03:08,300
Mom.

40
00:03:08,966 --> 00:03:10,600
I'm here to take you home.

41
00:03:29,766 --> 00:03:30,633
Thunder Bell,

42
00:03:31,266 --> 00:03:32,233
Sacred Wood Order.

43
00:03:33,266 --> 00:03:34,466
It seems that these two artifacts are

44
00:03:34,466 --> 00:03:36,066
the keys to open the Tian Gong Building.

45
00:03:44,166 --> 00:03:44,666
Who are you?

46
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:46,166
You heartless.

47
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,966
You forgot me so soon.

48
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:50,500
you are.

49
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:51,766
your savior.

50
00:03:51,966 --> 00:03:53,000
and your future partner.

51
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,100
Liu Ruonan.

52
00:03:56,666 --> 00:03:58,066
What are you doing?

53
00:03:58,266 --> 00:03:59,233
This is my room.

54
00:04:02,166 --> 00:04:03,000
Silly brother,

55
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:05,500
my Liu family's business spreads all over Jiuli.

56
00:04:05,666 --> 00:04:07,833
I own this hotel where you live.

57
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:10,066
Madam, I can't sleep at night,

58
00:04:10,266 --> 00:04:11,166
so I check the room.

59
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
No way.

60
00:04:14,433 --> 00:04:15,233
Don't come here.

61
00:04:15,433 --> 00:04:16,833
Fei.

62
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:19,633
Miao Xiaoqian,

63
00:04:20,133 --> 00:04:21,100
why are you here?

64
00:04:22,133 --> 00:04:23,433
I managed to escape.

65
00:04:23,433 --> 00:04:24,466
so I've been looking for you everywhere.

66
00:04:24,833 --> 00:04:26,233
In Jiuli, our words are our bond.

67
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:27,300
The engagement is done.

68
00:04:27,633 --> 00:04:28,466
and never regret.

69
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,600
I will always be yours.

70
00:04:30,766 --> 00:04:33,000
I have broken off with your Miao family.

71
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,566
Fei,

72
00:04:33,966 --> 00:04:35,333
I was forced by my family.

73
00:04:35,833 --> 00:04:37,500
I haven't forgotten you all these years.

74
00:04:37,633 --> 00:04:40,166
Miss Miao, are you afraid that we will be lonely?

75
00:04:40,333 --> 00:04:41,800
and want to come and keep us company?

76
00:04:44,366 --> 00:04:46,433
Then welcome.

77
00:05:01,166 --> 00:05:02,900
The Juli ghost plate has been taken away.

78
00:05:03,633 --> 00:05:05,400
The Blue Witch faction has guarded the tomb for generations.

79
00:05:05,633 --> 00:05:07,466
I can't let them touch the Tian Gong Tower.

80
00:05:17,633 --> 00:05:19,000
I've been sleeping for ten years.

81
00:05:19,266 --> 00:05:20,566
They should wake up.
